<title>ESTONIA: Estonian June CPI 0.7 pct mo/mo, 10.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Estonian June CPI 0.7 pct mo/mo, 10.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian consumer prices rose by a monthly 0.7 percent in June for a year-on-year inflation rate of 10.8 percent, the country's statistics department said on Monday.</p>
<p>    ESTONIAN CPI		     June 97    May 97     June 96</p>
<p>Month-on-month change (PCT)	  +0.7	+2.0	  +0.7</p>
<p>Year-on-year change (PCT)	   +10.8     +10.8	 +24.7</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
